          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zonke izinceku zakhe zahamba eceleni kwakhe; wonke amaKreti, nawo onke amaPheleti, nawo onke amaGati, amadoda angamakhulu ayisithupha amlandela evela eGati, awela phambi kwenkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
